ion": "Federal planning is incomplete without state tax consequences."}]}, {"id": "536ccc0e-3c89-4ce8-969e-5d9ae23fcd67", "type": "topic", "title": "Tax Compliance: Form 1120, Schedules, Disclosures, and IRS Procedure", "description": "Students connect doctrine to compliance workflow, return positions, disclosures, penalties, and audit readiness.", "children": [{"id": "fcdfeca3-14fc-4acd-af74-e237c3fc0daa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Form 1120 workflow", "children": [{"id": "80f1635f-12c3-478d-92ac-884c6449d0a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Taxable income schedule"}, {"id": "37b05e6e-8e76-4100-b052-1b676295b83a", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule M-1/M-3"}, {"id": "58ddacdc-a20c-4905-a3d3-dbe3816f7519", "type": "concept", "title": "Schedule K and balance sheet data"}], "description": "Students connect technical rules to corporate return preparation."}, {"id": "e337b4ec-b707-4882-990c-8cf470159506", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Disclosures and penalties", "children": [{"id": "5171ded3-8518-4ac4-b895-5c1c4b6c9da8", "type": "concept", "title": "Substantial authority"}, {"id": "3e28b388-7236-4199-a372-fad3fc883a1e", "type": "concept", "title": "Reasonable basis"}, {"id": "c2caf6df-73a7-48bc-8bfe-c2d039640915", "type": "concept", "title": "Form 8275 disclosure concepts"}], "description": "Return positions require judgment about support, disclosure, and penalty protection."}, {"id": "4d5dfca3-14c7-4e7c-83ec-dd03d3694093", "type": "subtopic", "title": "IRS procedure", "children": [{"id": "9415d383-78f8-412d-9ef6-633cb98429ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Examination process"}, {"id": "395aadc3-9f8e-4c15-b6b8-23bfdcb804c4", "type": "concept", "title": "Notices and adjustments"}, {"id": "31a80b89-69bc-447a-b985-64901e949773", "type": "concept", "title": "Administrative appeals preview"}], "description": "Students learn what happens after filing."}]}, {"id": "7d088c35-8f98-4681-9fe9-755dcd2cf29e", "type": "topic", "title": "Tax Accounting, ASC 740, Uncertain Tax Positions, and Financial Reporting", "description": "This topic connects corporate tax rules to financial reporting for income taxes.", "children": [{"id": "d594b515-ed0a-4100-94e7-134b4af0971b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Book-tax differences", "children": [{"id": "5f3eb932-c541-4568-9215-566a5227a6bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Permanent differences"}, {"id": "d91b88c0-e01e-4082-8b1f-1c5db00fe2e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Temporary differences"}, {"id": "5fae6103-2707-4c45-a1d5-cbbf4db38296", "type": "concept", "title": "Deferred tax assets and liabilities"}], "description": "Financial reporting separates current tax from deferred tax."}, {"id": "9ee2b58e-b9a7-41c4-a3bf-ad081aeb80a8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "ASC 740 basics", "children": [{"id": "ccc9460b-1985-444f-b06f-a1b515cd76df", "type": "concept", "title": "Current provision"}, {"id": "ac573c10-25ea-40f8-84a3-a059b25036db", "type": "concept", "title": "Deferred provision"}, {"id": "78a1d198-98e4-411a-9958-6d2e08243ad5", "type": "concept", "title": "Valuation allowance"}], "description": "Students learn the accounting framework for income taxes."}, {"id": "ab08b720-f5e5-40fa-97ac-95d90e2c2dc9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Uncertain tax positions", "children": [{"id": "960542a2-7724-4b24-a408-b6214148a54a", "type": "concept", "title": "Recognition threshold"}, {"id": "8b66cf15-87c2-49ee-858a-c0003901f622", "type": "concept", "title": "Measurement"}, {"id": "075c6ffa-76ae-466d-b4a2-a1c2561d543b", "type": "concept", "title": "Interest and penalties"}], "description": "Tax planning affects financial reporting risk and disclosure."}]}, {"id": "35d89a05-d985-4519-9b65-fc342104110a", "type": "topic", "title": "Ethics, Circular 230, Penalties, and Professional Judgment", "description": "Students learn the boundaries of tax planning, advocacy, disclosure, and professional responsibility.", "children": [{"id": "1fa289fa-8b97-43a7-ac21-ddf38caf733a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional responsibility", "children": [{"id": "b4c42b6d-3248-4da8-9ac0-3d49cee758ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Circular 230"}, {"id": "2aeaa95b-e417-463b-b601-1b76ccdb56b2", "type": "concept", "title": "AICPA Statements on Standards for Tax Services"}, {"id": "1a197942-b44b-4ae1-8e99-033f51cf1e8a", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest"}], "description": "Tax professionals must balance advocacy, accuracy, and public obligations."}, {"id": "b23a2f61-2804-4587-b085-2bf2d55beda2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Penalty standards", "children": [{"id": "2c9b90a1-164a-4e61-92f2-2babaffd62b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Accuracy-related penalties"}, {"id": "fa0444e2-47eb-46d1-8891-78adf7ad87be", "type": "concept", "title": "Preparer penalties"}, {"id": "911db7ef-dd35-44ac-92ae-ebb1ad27f4f3", "type": "concept", "title": "Reasonable cause"}], "description": "Students learn how penalty rules shape advice and return positions."}, {"id": "e0dba84c-bbc2-496f-a076-5147a237981d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethical planning", "children": [{"id": "30b86d50-abf9-4818-8f43-b314b73ac61e", "type": "concept", "title": "Tax avoidance versus evasion"}, {"id": "881d939c-f0ab-43da-9671-1f924ac18ea7", "type": "concept", "title": "Economic substance"}, {"id": "e5cb0ba7-5c5a-414a-9bca-719ee4ada235", "type": "concept", "title": "Client communication"}], "description": "World-class tax planning respects both legal boundaries and reputational risk."}]}, {"id": "c2cbed5f-301a-4796-8677-776d10445e98", "type": "topic", "title": "Corporate Tax Research and Planning Capstone", "description": "The course culminates in a corporate tax research memo and planning presentation grounded in facts, authority, computations, and risk analysis.", "children": [{"id": "44707670-f135-4d8f-aff4-4bb25644bf43", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fact pattern and issue list", "children": [{"id": "c7f7c690-8255-4e76-8507-3d93419af6cb", "type": "concept", "title": "Client facts"}, {"id": "3a27c666-037b-4f90-bf7e-233adda593f2",